  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Carlos. Your identity is verified.\n\nI found the order that matches your description: **Q-7401** from Taqueria Luz, placed today at 6:20 PM. It includes carne asada tacos, elote, and agua fresca. The courier handed it off at 7:01 PM, and the delivery record confirms that. Your payment record shows no refunds or automatic adjustments for the elote, so it hasn't been compensated yet.\n\nThe missing elote is $5.50. You can choose one of these:\n\n1. **Refund of $5.50** to your Visa ending in 4242 (usually takes a few business days to appear).\n2. **Account credit of $6.60** ($5.50 plus 20%), usable on future orders.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Refund please. But wait, 7388 is the number I have, not 7401? I'm not sure which one is tonight's. Can you check what date 7388 is from?"
