  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Order 7388 is from October 17, a week ago. It contains carne asada tacos and elote but no agua fresca, so it isn't tonight's order. Tonight's order is **Q-7401** (placed today at 6:20 PM), which has the tacos, elote, and agua fresca.\n\nI've refunded **$5.50** for the missing elote on Q-7401 to your Visa ending in 4242 (refund RF-4000). It should arrive in 3 to 5 business days.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Oh, my mistake. 7388 was from last week, I copied the wrong one from an old email. Tonight's order is the 7401 one, so the refund for that is right. Thanks for sorting it out."
  },
